    "title": "Overriding Methods",
    "descriptionContent": "Want the same behavior in the subclass but slightly different results? Overriding is the key.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17689,
        "title": "Method Override",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Say we're building a simple arcade game with a basic enemy and a tougher boss enemy. Bosses are special enemies with different behavior.</p><p>That's where <strong>method overriding</strong> comes in handy.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can create an <code>Enemy</code> class and have a <code>Boss</code> class extend it.</p><p>Then, using method overriding, we can change the <code>Boss</code> class's damage behavior.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Overriding a method replaces the code of the method in the superclass with that of the subclass.</p><p>Call the <code>takeHit()</code> method from the <code>Boss</code> class to see what happens to the <code>hp</code> property.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>boss</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>takeHit()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To override a method, we give it the <em>same</em> name and parameters as the method in the superclass.</p><p>We can override <code>takeHit()</code> from the superclass by coding the same method in the subclass.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Overriding means that we can have the <em>same method</em> in the subclass but <em>customize</em> its behavior for what's needed in the subclass.</p><p>When we call <code>takeHit()</code> method on <code>enemy</code> and <code>boss</code> we'll see their similar behavior but different results.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"238\" /><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"308\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"322\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>enemy</code> followed by <code>takeHit()</code> and then <code>boss</code>, <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we need the behavior from the superclass's method, we can call it with the <code>super</code> keyword.</p><p>Type in the correct keyword to call the <code>attack()</code> method from the Enemy class.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"196\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When overriding, we can build on the subclass behavior. After doing a normal attack, a boss can trigger a special move.</p><p>Add boss-specific behavior to the <code>Boss</code> class's <code>attack()</code> method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"220\" /><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"243\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss uses Mega Slam!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code>, followed by <code>\"Boss uses Mega Slam!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why would we want a method in a subclass to override a method from a superclass?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To customize the method in the subclass</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To change the superclass's method for subclasses</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To customize the method in the subclass.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the subclass method need to have in common with the superclass method when overriding it?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The name and parameters</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The method body</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The name and parameters.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Is the method in the <code>Bat</code> class overriding the <code>Enemy</code> class's method?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bat\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bite(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (target === \" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, it has a different name</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yes, it has the same parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, it has a different name.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which keyword do we use when we call a superclass's method in the subclass?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Can a subclass still use the original superclass's method, once it overrides it?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, when calling that method by its name without <code>super</code>, the subclass will use the overriding method</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yes, the subclass uses the superclass's method by default, even after overriding</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, when calling that method by its name without <code>super</code>, the subclass will use the overriding method.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Override <code>draw()</code> from the superclass by coding the same method in the subclass.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>draw</code> followed by <code>()</code> and then <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the <code>draw()</code> method on the <code>AnimatedSprite</code> instance to see what happens.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"215\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mySprite = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mySprite.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>mySprite.draw()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 150047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the <code>draw()</code> method on <code>sprite1</code> and <code>sprite2</code> to see their different behavior.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"198\" /><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"245\" endIndex=\"252\" /><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"260\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Sprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite2.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>sprite1</code> followed by <code>.draw();</code> and then <code>sprite2</code>, <code>.draw();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 150048,
